# Security response headers for all routes (Cloudflare Pages honors this file).
# Kept conservative on purpose - none of these can break a static site.
# A Content-Security-Policy is intentionally NOT set here: Cloudflare injects its
# Web Analytics beacon at the edge, so a CSP must be added + tested against the
# live site (not local preview) to avoid blocking that beacon or view transitions.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
